# 🛒 E-Commerce Backend (Spring Boot)
This project is currently under development and represents the backend part only of an e-commerce application.
I am building this project while learning and working on it by myself.

At this stage, the project is not complete, so this README only briefly mentions what has been implemented so far. Once the project is fully completed, I will update this README with a detailed explanation of the complete system, including how each feature works and how the logic is implemented.

Thank you for taking the time to review this repository.
I really appreciate it.

Peace

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
If you would like to understand the logic in more detail, please refer to the Detail file.

Also, if you notice any typing or grammar mistakes in the Detail file, please ignore them.
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

## Features
- User Registration & Login (JWT)
- Role-based Authorization (ADMIN / USER)
- Product Management (Admin only)
- Secure Image Upload
- Cart Management
- Global Exception Handling
- MongoDB Integration

## Tech Stack
- Java 17
- Spring Boot
- Spring Security
- JWT
- MongoDB
- Maven

## API Modules
- Auth
- Products
- Cart
- Orders (coming next)

## Security
- Stateless JWT authentication
- Role-based access control

## Status
🚧 Order module in progress
